{"After the initial read-lock check, the code acquires a write lock but does not re-check whether the cache has been populated by another goroutine in the meantime, leading to redundant recomputation and potentially overwriting when a concurrent request already updated the cache": 0.941259503364563, "The write lock is acquired early and held for the remainder of the function including filesystem/network I/O needed to build the assets, which can serialize concurrent requests unnecessarily": 0.8022812604904175}